	(text "Vin = 12 V\nVref = 1.23 V\nVoutmin = Vref = 1.23 V (at R2 = 0 ohm)\nVoutmax = Vin - 2 V = 12 V - 2 V = 10 V\n\nVout = Vref * (1 + R2 / R1)\nR2 = R1 * ((Vout / Vref) - 1)\n\nR1 = 3 kOhm (fixed THT resistor)\nR2 calc = 3 kOhm * ((10 / 1.23) - 1) = 21.39 kOhm\nSelected R2 = RV1 = 25 kOhm THT Potentiometer"
